    "meaning": "Approved complete external guideline with a reference-only consumer lock, required root AGENTS bootstrap, dependency-closed risk-scoped source verification, content-bound changed evidence, strict revision-bound release evidence, evidence-scoped completion claims, mandatory executable UI and temporal rules, server-authorized audience projection, canonical vocabulary, complete project-book and database contracts, schema-reconciled data documentation, referenced-record lifecycle resolution, and focused proof requirements on 2026-09-01."
